#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:4
msgid "class kptmatch -- Keypoint match object"
msgstr "class kptmatch -- Objet de correspondance de points clés"

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:6
msgid ""
"The kptmatch object is an `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_"
" returned by `image.match_descriptor()` when matching two ORB keypoint "
"descriptors. It describes the cluster of matched keypoints between the two "
"descriptors: its bounding box, centroid, the number of matched keypoints, an"
" estimated in-image-plane rotation, and the per-keypoint ``(x, y)`` list of "
"matches."
msgstr ""
"L'objet kptmatch est un `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_"
" renvoyé par `image.match_descriptor()` lors de la mise en correspondance de"
" deux descripteurs de points clés ORB. Il décrit le groupe de points clés "
"correspondants entre les deux descripteurs : sa boîte englobante, son "
"centroïde, le nombre de points clés correspondants, une rotation estimée "
"dans le plan de l'image, ainsi que la liste ``(x, y)`` des correspondances "
"pour chaque point clé."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:13
msgid ""
"Fields are accessible by attribute name (``match.count``) or by index "
"(``match[0]``). The object has no public constructor."
msgstr ""
"Les champs sont accessibles par nom d'attribut (``match.count``) ou par "
"index (``match[0]``). L'objet n'a pas de constructeur public."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:18
msgid "Please call `image.match_descriptor()` to create this object."
msgstr "Veuillez appeler `image.match_descriptor()` pour créer cet objet."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:21
msgid "Bounding box and centroid"
msgstr "Boîte englobante et centroïde"

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:25
msgid ""
"Bounding box top-left x coordinate of the matched keypoints, in pixels. "
"Integer. Index ``[0]``."
msgstr ""
"Coordonnée x du coin supérieur gauche de la boîte englobante des points clés"
" correspondants, en pixels. Entier. Index ``[0]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:30
msgid ""
"Bounding box top-left y coordinate of the matched keypoints, in pixels. "
"Integer. Index ``[1]``."
msgstr ""
"Coordonnée y du coin supérieur gauche de la boîte englobante des points clés"
" correspondants, en pixels. Entier. Index ``[1]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:35
msgid ""
"Bounding box width of the matched keypoints, in pixels. Integer. Index "
"``[2]``."
msgstr ""
"Largeur de la boîte englobante des points clés correspondants, en pixels. "
"Entier. Index ``[2]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:40
msgid ""
"Bounding box height of the matched keypoints, in pixels. Integer. Index "
"``[3]``."
msgstr ""
"Hauteur de la boîte englobante des points clés correspondants, en pixels. "
"Entier. Index ``[3]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:45
msgid ""
"Centroid x coordinate of the matched keypoints. Integer. Index ``[4]``."
msgstr ""
"Coordonnée x du centroïde des points clés correspondants. Entier. Index "
"``[4]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:50
msgid ""
"Centroid y coordinate of the matched keypoints. Integer. Index ``[5]``."
msgstr ""
"Coordonnée y du centroïde des points clés correspondants. Entier. Index "
"``[5]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:55
msgid ""
"``(x, y, w, h)`` 4-tuple of the bounding box. Suitable for passing directly "
"to drawing/cropping methods such as `Image.draw_rectangle()` or "
"`Image.crop()`. Index ``[9]``."
msgstr ""
"Quadruplet ``(x, y, w, h)`` de la boîte englobante. Adapté à une "
"transmission directe aux méthodes de dessin/recadrage telles que "
"`Image.draw_rectangle()` ou `Image.crop()`. Index ``[9]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:60
msgid "Match details"
msgstr "Détails de la correspondance"

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:64
msgid ""
"Number of keypoints that matched between the two descriptors. Use this as a "
"confidence score -- typical thresholds for a \"real\" match are 10+ "
"keypoints. Integer. Index ``[6]``."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de points clés ayant correspondu entre les deux descripteurs. "
"Utilisez cette valeur comme score de confiance -- les seuils typiques pour "
"une \"vraie\" correspondance sont de 10 points clés ou plus. Entier. Index "
"``[6]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:70
msgid ""
"Estimated in-image-plane rotation between the two descriptors, in degrees. "
"Integer. Index ``[7]``."
msgstr ""
"Rotation estimée dans le plan de l'image entre les deux descripteurs, en "
"degrés. Entier. Index ``[7]``."

#: ../../library/omv.image.kptmatch.rst:75
msgid ""
"List of ``(x, y)`` integer tuples giving the pixel location of each matched "
"keypoint in the search image. ``len(match) == count``. Index ``[8]``."
msgstr ""
"Liste de tuples d'entiers ``(x, y)`` donnant la position en pixels de chaque"
" point clé correspondant dans l'image de recherche. ``len(match) == count``."
" Index ``[8]``."
